<title>UK: UK's Labour holds Wrexham with swing of 7.4 pct.</title>
<headline>UK's Labour holds Wrexham with swing of 7.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's opposition Labour Party held the safe seat of Wrexham with a swing in its favour of 7.4 percent.</p>
<p>The Labour candidate won 20,450 votes compared with 8,688 votes for the Conservatives.</p>
<p>-- Rosemary Bennett +44 171 542 7715</p>
